WEBVTT

00:00.290 --> 00:02.910
What's the point of studying?

00:02.910 --> 00:04.320
I don't get it.

00:04.320 --> 00:07.690
To figure out what you don't get, maybe?

00:08.780 --> 00:11.820
Yoka, sometimes I don't get you, either.

00:19.560 --> 00:21.650
Shizuru-chan, what'd you wish for?

00:21.650 --> 00:22.700
Not telling!

00:22.700 --> 00:23.720
What'd you wish for?

00:23.720 --> 00:24.360
What?!

00:24.360 --> 00:25.240
I'm not saying!

00:25.250 --> 00:31.710
<b>31st Agano Archery Competition</b>

00:33.030 --> 00:35.070
Get him, Nadeko-chan!

00:35.070 --> 00:36.690
Kick his butt!

00:35.760 --> 00:37.350
Kick his butt!

00:38.520 --> 00:41.600
Kick his butt! Go, go!

00:41.180 --> 00:42.290
You can do it...

00:42.690 --> 00:44.030
Kick his butt!

00:59.330 --> 01:03.080
<b>Train to the End of the World</b>

02:20.870 --> 02:22.480
What the hell?!

02:22.480 --> 02:24.090
Are you okay, Shizuru-chan?!

02:24.080 --> 02:28.830
Episode 5       I'll Be Reduced to Bones

02:24.090 --> 02:27.730
Those tiny soldiers we saw 
must have done this to us!

02:27.730 --> 02:28.830
I'm alive.

02:28.830 --> 02:30.620
I can't move at all!

02:30.620 --> 02:31.830
How about you?

02:36.000 --> 02:36.910
No use.

02:36.910 --> 02:39.970
Man, they really got us good, though,
 with those missile-looking things.

02:39.970 --> 02:42.270
They didn't just look it, 
those <i>were</i> missiles!

02:42.270 --> 02:45.970
The mini-mini soldiers unloaded those 
nasty, itchy bullets on us, too!

02:45.970 --> 02:47.160
I know what it is!

02:47.160 --> 02:49.740
The bullets hurt less 
because they're so small!

02:49.740 --> 02:50.550
Really?

02:50.550 --> 02:51.680
I dunno, probably!

02:51.680 --> 02:54.070
Anyway, we need to get these off!

02:53.280 --> 02:54.810
Yeah, you're right.

02:54.810 --> 02:57.610
Ah, sheesh!

03:13.050 --> 03:15.010
Who in the world <i>are</i> you?

03:15.300 --> 03:16.890
Take these off first.

03:16.890 --> 03:17.700
Answer me.

03:17.700 --> 03:19.080
No way. Untie me, and I'll talk.

03:20.300 --> 03:22.590
You can stay tied up until you die, then.

03:24.010 --> 03:25.740
We came from Agano!

03:26.570 --> 03:27.820
Agano?

03:28.380 --> 03:30.840
The people in Agano didn't change, either?

03:30.840 --> 03:32.910
Either? Did you say "either"?

03:32.910 --> 03:35.840
I'm asking if the folks 
in Agano stayed the same!

03:35.840 --> 03:39.180
It hasn't happened yet, but we'll 
eventually turn into animals.

03:39.450 --> 03:40.990
Why did you come here?

03:42.580 --> 03:43.680
For a walk.

03:43.150 --> 03:44.770
We're trying to find medical help!

03:44.770 --> 03:45.990
Why'd you tell him?!

03:45.990 --> 03:47.100
I shouldn't have?

03:47.100 --> 03:48.880
I was going to tell him little by little!

03:48.880 --> 03:50.470
I didn't know that!

03:50.470 --> 03:52.820
If you spill the beans, 
we have nothing to bargain with!

03:52.830 --> 03:55.000
What? I said I'd talk if they untied us.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.920
That's why that guy tried to leave!

03:56.920 --> 03:59.400
You can't take that attitude from the start!

03:59.400 --> 04:01.020
Well, that guy annoys me a lot!

04:01.020 --> 04:03.430
He annoys <i>me</i> just as much!

04:03.430 --> 04:05.370
Spin the blades!

04:11.190 --> 04:12.350
What, what?!

04:12.350 --> 04:14.020
H-H-Hey!

04:14.020 --> 04:15.620
Ow! Stop th—Ow!

04:15.190 --> 04:17.230
Sorry! We're sorry!

04:15.620 --> 04:17.230
Ow! My face! It hurts!

04:17.230 --> 04:17.990
Stop the blades.

04:20.190 --> 04:21.900
Quit your damn yapping!

04:21.900 --> 04:23.880
I'm the one asking the questions!

04:23.880 --> 04:25.440
Who said you could argue?!

04:25.440 --> 04:27.290
Or insult me, for that matter?!

04:27.290 --> 04:28.490
He's really mad all of a sudden.

04:28.490 --> 04:29.490
I'm not mad!

04:29.490 --> 04:31.130
You little girls can't make me mad!

04:31.130 --> 04:32.320
I'm the captain here!

04:32.320 --> 04:34.030
Why would the captain get mad at—

04:34.030 --> 04:34.500
Captain.

04:34.500 --> 04:35.940
Yeah, all right!

04:36.980 --> 04:39.300
Surely you can find medical 
help in Agano, too.

04:39.710 --> 04:41.540
We're looking for someone called the Doctor.

04:43.330 --> 04:44.820
You know the Doctor?

04:44.820 --> 04:48.660
We pulled some mushrooms off of our friend, 
and now she might die!

04:48.660 --> 04:49.730
Mushrooms?

04:49.730 --> 04:51.620
Is that due to 7G as well?

04:51.620 --> 04:53.060
Obviously!

04:53.620 --> 04:54.950
It is, right?

04:54.950 --> 04:55.680
Has to be.

04:56.090 --> 04:58.390
It's just like the Boss said.

04:59.060 --> 05:00.410
What's gotten into them?

05:00.410 --> 05:01.760
We need to report this at once.

05:01.760 --> 05:02.540
Hey!

05:02.540 --> 05:04.220
We talked, so untie us!

05:04.220 --> 05:06.020
I never agreed to that.

05:06.020 --> 05:08.920
We can't let news of our town 
reach outside ears.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.810
Why not?

05:09.810 --> 05:12.570
It was a decision made by our astute boss.

05:12.570 --> 05:13.040
"Boss"?

05:13.440 --> 05:16.680
On the Boss's orders, your skeletons 
will be displayed tomorrow,

05:16.680 --> 05:19.790
next to the Akebono elephant 
fossil in Sayama City Museum.

05:19.790 --> 05:21.050
Wait, skeletons?

05:21.050 --> 05:22.860
We'd die if we became skeletons!

05:22.860 --> 05:24.320
That's a death sentence!

05:24.830 --> 05:26.350
Hey, wait!

05:26.350 --> 05:29.560
Let us go, you puny little insects!

05:30.490 --> 05:31.650
Current, check.

05:31.650 --> 05:32.770
Voltage, check.

05:32.090 --> 05:34.500
Nadeko-chan! Anthony!

05:34.500 --> 05:35.880
Come here!

05:35.880 --> 05:37.920
Okay, give me a minute.

05:37.920 --> 05:40.310
Pochi-san. Akira-chan's calling you!

05:40.310 --> 05:42.640
Quick, come here!

05:41.510 --> 05:42.980
Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay.

05:42.980 --> 05:43.760
Check!

05:44.120 --> 05:45.410
What's wrong, Akira-chan?

05:45.410 --> 05:48.760
Where did Reimi-chan and Shizuru-chan go?

05:48.760 --> 05:51.480
Akira's bored all alone here.

05:51.480 --> 05:52.530
I bet you are.

05:52.530 --> 05:55.090
They'll be back in no time. 
Can you wait a little longer?

05:55.090 --> 05:58.590
I bet they took a detour 
to grab some ice cream!

05:58.590 --> 06:01.500
So I'll play with Anthony instead.

06:02.160 --> 06:05.330
Pochi-san. She's in your paws 
while I finish my inspection.

06:06.040 --> 06:09.420
Anthony, you're so fluffy and cute.

06:09.420 --> 06:12.680
Your face keeps getting scrunchier.

06:13.260 --> 06:15.310
Agh, my wrists hurt!

06:15.310 --> 06:17.040
Stop that. You'll make them bleed.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.870
We've got more pressing issues here!

06:18.870 --> 06:20.060
You'll snap your bracelet!

06:20.950 --> 06:23.050
Hear me out here.

06:23.050 --> 06:23.680
Sure.

06:23.680 --> 06:26.370
We know that the Doctor 
is here in this town.

06:26.370 --> 06:27.080
Yeah.

06:27.080 --> 06:29.020
Now we just need to find them.

06:29.020 --> 06:29.820
Huh?

06:29.820 --> 06:31.540
How about a way to break free?

06:31.540 --> 06:32.330
No idea yet.

06:32.330 --> 06:33.030
There!

06:33.030 --> 06:34.550
That's the important part!

06:34.550 --> 06:36.660
You got my hopes up! I regret it now!

06:36.660 --> 06:39.080
Isn't there something we can do?

06:41.610 --> 06:42.290
Hey, hey!

06:42.290 --> 06:44.160
Hey, wait! Wait up, lady!

06:44.160 --> 06:46.540
Undo these ropes, please!

06:46.540 --> 06:49.430
We're not here to harm you.

06:49.430 --> 06:52.680
All we want is for this Doctor 
person to help our friend!

06:53.410 --> 06:57.840
If I talk to you, the Boss will 
have my skeleton put on display.

06:57.840 --> 06:59.580
Seriously, who is this boss, anyway?!

06:59.580 --> 07:01.590
If I tell you, I'll be reduced to bones.

07:01.590 --> 07:03.770
Then why did you approach us?

07:03.770 --> 07:05.530
You must have had a reason!

07:05.530 --> 07:09.750
I'm in charge of cleaning this area, 
so I was checking for trash.

07:09.750 --> 07:12.150
If anything's dirty, 
I'll be reduced to bones.

07:12.150 --> 07:12.980
How about this?

07:12.980 --> 07:14.880
We'll help you pick up garbage!

07:14.880 --> 07:15.920
Hey!

07:15.920 --> 07:16.950
Pee.

07:17.820 --> 07:19.040
Shizuru-chan?!

07:19.040 --> 07:20.740
I'll pee myself, right here.

07:20.740 --> 07:22.770
I've needed to use the 
bathroom this whole time.

07:22.770 --> 07:25.310
I can't hold it in, so I'll just pee here.

07:26.050 --> 07:28.700
The park will end up a mess, but oh well.

07:28.700 --> 07:30.380
I need to pee, too!

07:30.380 --> 07:31.630
Like, a lot!

07:31.630 --> 07:32.680
Not my problem.

07:32.680 --> 07:35.200
If you untie us, I promise 
we'll take down the Boss.

07:35.200 --> 07:38.060
Shizuru-chan's a real badass, 
with her Agano jiu-jitsu!

07:38.060 --> 07:39.940
And I'm... pretty badass, too!

07:39.940 --> 07:42.670
Help us and become a skeleton,

07:42.670 --> 07:44.690
or get peed on and become a skeleton.

07:44.690 --> 07:45.870
Pick one.

07:47.500 --> 07:48.930
Ah, a little came out.

07:49.710 --> 07:50.900
Thanks, lady!

07:50.900 --> 07:52.090
Ow, ow, ow...

07:52.090 --> 07:52.880
Oh, sorry.

07:52.880 --> 07:54.090
We'll beat up the Boss.

07:54.090 --> 07:55.710
But take us to the Doctor first.

07:56.090 --> 07:58.940
The Doctor's been captured by the Boss.

07:58.940 --> 08:00.450
What? No way!

08:00.450 --> 08:03.920
So, first we'll need to help someone 
who knows the Doctor's whereabouts.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.450
No one's here.

08:05.450 --> 08:07.530
We've been placed under a curfew.

08:07.530 --> 08:09.930
Why's the Doctor imprisoned, anyway?

08:10.380 --> 08:12.350
Let me start from the beginning.

08:12.350 --> 08:17.170
Most likely, our transformation 
was caused by that 7G incident.

08:17.170 --> 08:21.190
After first swelling greatly in size, 
the recoil caused the town to turn small.

08:21.190 --> 08:24.390
Amidst the chaos, one person 
brought the townsfolk together.

08:24.390 --> 08:27.670
That would be the Doctor, 
Gappa Makoto Ångström-san.

08:27.670 --> 08:29.350
Sounds amazing, name and all!

08:29.350 --> 08:31.820
The people appointed 
Makoto-sensei as their leader,

08:31.820 --> 08:35.480
and were able to sustain their way of life 
without issue, other than their size.

08:35.480 --> 08:38.580
But that was before the Boss arrived.

08:38.580 --> 08:41.010
The Boss seized control 
of the town in no time,

08:41.010 --> 08:45.150
imprisoning Makoto-sensei 
in an unknown location.

08:45.150 --> 08:46.840
Is the Boss really <i>that</i> strong?

08:46.840 --> 08:51.000
In time, the town was divided between 
the Inariyama upper class, loyal to the Boss,

08:51.000 --> 08:54.810
and the Inariyama lower class, 
who were deprived of their freedom.

08:54.810 --> 08:58.430
We lower-class citizens are 
under constant supervision

08:58.430 --> 09:00.940
and exist solely for infrastructure upkeep.

09:00.940 --> 09:02.870
Infrastructure? Is that like influenza?

09:02.870 --> 09:04.710
We're forced to maintain the military base

09:04.710 --> 09:07.410
and generate electricity to be 
used by the Boss for his enjoyment.

09:07.410 --> 09:08.760
That's awful!

09:08.760 --> 09:10.870
Everyone has given up.

09:10.870 --> 09:13.520
But if Makoto-sensei were to return,

09:13.520 --> 09:15.910
maybe we could all unite and fight back!

09:15.910 --> 09:17.820
That's why you came to us?

09:17.820 --> 09:18.360
Yes.

09:23.740 --> 09:25.580
What now, Shizuru-chan?

09:43.700 --> 09:44.720
Please!

09:44.720 --> 09:47.050
Tell us where they've taken Makoto-sensei.

09:47.050 --> 09:49.350
As a former upper-class citizen, 
I'm sure you know.

09:51.150 --> 09:52.070
Um...

09:52.790 --> 09:55.060
We promise not to rat you out.

09:55.060 --> 09:56.180
Let's see...

09:56.180 --> 09:58.090
Currently in Inariyama Park.

09:58.090 --> 10:00.020
Searching for physician.

10:00.020 --> 10:02.080
<i>Why a physician, of all things?</i>

10:02.080 --> 10:02.710
<i>Is someone sick?!</i>

10:02.710 --> 10:03.420
What?

10:03.420 --> 10:05.930
Didn't we say Akira-chan had 
mushrooms growing on her?

10:05.930 --> 10:07.190
<i>Heard about mushrooms.</i>

10:07.190 --> 10:08.200
<i>This physician stuff's new!</i>

10:08.200 --> 10:10.950
Didn't you say there was a 
physician in Inariyama Park?

10:10.950 --> 10:11.910
<i>No!</i>

10:11.910 --> 10:14.850
<i>That's not whachoo choo-choo...</i>

10:15.220 --> 10:17.450
Nadeko-chan, are you in trouble?

10:17.450 --> 10:18.820
You can tell from my face?

10:18.820 --> 10:21.760
Actually, Akira is in trouble, too.

10:21.760 --> 10:24.680
My body feels heavy, and I can't move.

10:23.920 --> 10:24.680
Akira-chan!

10:25.020 --> 10:26.830
But no need to worry!

10:26.830 --> 10:30.990
When I'm in trouble, Reimi-chan 
always shows up to save the day.

10:31.450 --> 10:34.180
My tummy hurt so much, you know!

10:34.180 --> 10:36.230
I didn't think you'd actually eat it!

10:36.230 --> 10:38.550
There's nothing left of my textbook now!

10:37.600 --> 10:39.590
Serves you right for taking the easy way out!

10:39.590 --> 10:41.090
We're not friends anymore!

10:41.090 --> 10:42.190
See if I care!

10:42.470 --> 10:44.540
Hey, whatcha reading?

10:45.290 --> 10:46.550
Ugh, looks boring!

10:46.550 --> 10:47.620
Nothing but words!

10:47.620 --> 10:49.240
I think it's fun...

10:49.240 --> 10:50.010
Huh?!

10:50.010 --> 10:53.340
Did you just laugh at us because 
Nishi-Agano's on the Chichibu Line?!

10:53.340 --> 10:54.600
Stop it!

10:55.110 --> 10:56.920
Hey, you!

10:56.920 --> 10:59.640
What d'you think you're doing to Akira?!

10:59.640 --> 11:02.170
But she's a <i>teensy</i> bit late today.

11:02.470 --> 11:05.820
She's in for a scolding 
when she gets back. Hmph.

11:05.820 --> 11:06.430
Yeah.

11:06.430 --> 11:07.370
Okay!

11:07.370 --> 11:09.570
I'll give her a scolding, too!

11:09.940 --> 11:11.600
Please do.

11:13.980 --> 11:16.530
<b>JASDF</b>

11:13.980 --> 11:16.530
<b>My Awesome Base</b>

11:43.370 --> 11:44.690
Makoto-sensei!

11:45.440 --> 11:46.890
Yamada, what's going on?

11:46.890 --> 11:47.840
We can talk after.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.900
We'll save you, so come here!

11:58.150 --> 12:02.140
What are you vermin doing in my base?

12:02.140 --> 12:02.770
He's huge!

12:02.770 --> 12:03.920
Or, well, normal.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.170
It all makes sense now.

12:05.170 --> 12:06.140
How did you escape?!

12:06.140 --> 12:07.460
Not telling, dummy!

12:07.460 --> 12:09.290
If you act out of line any further,

12:09.290 --> 12:12.030
I'll rip your heads off 
and beat you to a pulp!

12:12.030 --> 12:13.810
<i>You're</i> the one acting out of line here!

12:13.810 --> 12:14.770
We heard everything.

12:14.770 --> 12:16.460
Hey, little close there. What's your deal?

12:16.460 --> 12:19.210
I had no idea why everyone was obeying you.

12:19.210 --> 12:20.720
It's just because you're big!

12:21.070 --> 12:22.850
Hey, what do <i>you</i> know?!

12:22.850 --> 12:25.420
I can't stand dumb, 
arrogant gyaru like you—

12:25.420 --> 12:27.680
I totally hate guys like you, too.

12:27.680 --> 12:28.800
Hey, hold on.

12:28.800 --> 12:30.870
I hate you way, way, <i>way</i> more!

12:30.870 --> 12:32.210
Hey, c'mon. What are you doing?

12:32.210 --> 12:33.560
Shoot them already!

12:33.560 --> 12:34.430
Fire!

12:34.760 --> 12:36.070
Engage!

12:36.070 --> 12:38.260
That barely even stings!

12:38.260 --> 12:39.470
Hi-yah!

12:39.470 --> 12:41.360
Launch tranq missiles!

12:42.320 --> 12:43.170
There!

12:43.610 --> 12:44.990
You won't get me twice with that!

12:44.990 --> 12:46.830
I know what you're up to!

12:46.830 --> 12:49.610
You rats want to cozy up to the 
Doctor and take over this town!

12:49.610 --> 12:50.290
Huh?

12:50.290 --> 12:52.420
Over my dead body, you dumb gyaru!

12:52.420 --> 12:53.950
What are you, stupid?

12:53.950 --> 12:54.440
Ha!

12:58.500 --> 13:00.010
Nice one, Shizuru-chan!

13:00.010 --> 13:00.990
Leave them to me.

13:00.990 --> 13:01.820
Get the doc to Akira!

13:01.820 --> 13:02.200
What?

13:02.200 --> 13:02.940
Hurry!

13:02.940 --> 13:04.080
Don't just stand there!

13:04.080 --> 13:05.720
Shoot the Doctor already!

13:05.720 --> 13:07.300
Fire, fire, fire, fire!

13:08.210 --> 13:09.610
Hi-yah!

13:11.580 --> 13:12.600
Don't let them escape!

13:12.600 --> 13:14.360
Fire, fire, fire!

13:25.450 --> 13:26.400
I'm here!

13:26.400 --> 13:27.210
Reimi-chan!

13:27.210 --> 13:28.850
So slow!

13:28.850 --> 13:30.380
Action figures!

13:30.380 --> 13:31.290
Wait, what?!

13:31.290 --> 13:33.100
The Doctor and some folks from Inariyama.

13:33.100 --> 13:35.110
Once Akira's better, 
we gotta go help Shizuru-chan.

13:35.110 --> 13:36.770
Shizu... What's going on?!

13:36.770 --> 13:37.620
Look, Akira.

13:37.620 --> 13:38.750
We brought a physician.

13:38.750 --> 13:40.830
Wait. I'm no physician.

13:40.830 --> 13:41.300
What?!

13:41.300 --> 13:42.680
Aren't you a doctor?!

13:42.680 --> 13:44.200
I'm a scientist.

13:44.800 --> 13:47.240
Then you're no help! You can't fix her!

13:47.240 --> 13:49.020
Why don't you tell me what happened first?

13:49.020 --> 13:51.420
What's the point if you're not a physician?!

13:51.420 --> 13:54.580
When we pulled out these mushrooms 
growing from her butt a few hours ago,

13:54.580 --> 13:55.930
her entire personality changed.

13:55.930 --> 13:58.270
She's slowly becoming unable to move her body.

13:58.620 --> 13:59.370
Let me take a look.

14:02.040 --> 14:03.600
Akira-kun, was it?

14:03.600 --> 14:06.920
After the mushrooms were pulled, has anything
changed other than your body feeling heavy?

14:06.920 --> 14:09.190
Lemme see...

14:09.190 --> 14:11.750
It feels cold and empty inside my head.

14:11.750 --> 14:13.290
You girls lucked out.

14:13.290 --> 14:15.450
If this is caused by 7G, 
a physician can't help her.

14:15.450 --> 14:17.270
So, can you help her, Sensei?

14:17.270 --> 14:18.110
Not so fast.

14:18.110 --> 14:20.060
This isn't my area of specialty as a scientist.

14:20.060 --> 14:23.670
But as a researcher who was involved 
with 7G, I can venture a guess.

14:23.670 --> 14:24.090
What?

14:24.090 --> 14:25.710
You worked on 7G?!

14:25.710 --> 14:28.020
So the reason that the Boss 
was scared of you...

14:28.020 --> 14:32.320
He knew of my experience and figured 
I might be able to return the town to normal.

14:32.810 --> 14:37.270
We refer to what occurred as the 
"7G wave brain phenomenon."

14:37.270 --> 14:38.970
Seven ele— what?

14:38.970 --> 14:44.460
Under the effects of 7G, one's perception 
can cause drastic changes to one's own body.

14:44.460 --> 14:45.970
By undoing said perception—

14:45.970 --> 14:47.580
In simpler terms!

14:46.870 --> 14:49.300
In other words, the changes to Akira-kun

14:49.300 --> 14:53.200
result from her perception that a vital part 
of her got pulled out with the mushrooms.

14:53.200 --> 14:55.590
Which means that to convince her 
that she's back to normal,

14:55.590 --> 14:57.050
you need to feed her some mushrooms.

14:57.050 --> 14:57.810
What?

14:57.810 --> 14:59.900
Mushrooms. Don't you have any?

14:59.900 --> 15:01.030
No, we don't.

15:01.030 --> 15:02.810
Are we going back to Higashi-Agano?!

15:02.810 --> 15:05.620
No. I believe there were some 
growing in the Boss's room.

15:05.620 --> 15:06.250
Mushrooms?!

15:06.550 --> 15:10.630
If Zenjiro were still alive, he might 
have found a better course of action.

15:10.630 --> 15:12.380
What? Did you say Zenjiro?

15:12.380 --> 15:15.230
Do you mean Taira Zenjiro from Agano?

15:15.230 --> 15:16.590
How do you know him?!

15:16.590 --> 15:18.080
Is he still alive?!

15:18.080 --> 15:20.470
He's alive... though his brain is addled.

15:21.860 --> 15:23.200
Zenjiro...

15:29.950 --> 15:31.780
Wibble-wobble, go!

15:31.780 --> 15:34.150
Commencing wibble-wobble surgery.

15:41.710 --> 15:42.600
Run for it!

15:43.410 --> 15:45.390
Don't stop! Hurry!

15:45.390 --> 15:46.820
Get out of here!

15:50.900 --> 15:53.470
I owe Zenjiro my life.

15:53.890 --> 15:56.420
But for now, Akira-kun comes first.

16:01.680 --> 16:05.480
Where... am I?

16:05.790 --> 16:07.220
This is my room.

16:07.580 --> 16:09.060
What do you want with me?

16:09.060 --> 16:10.850
Gonna execute me and put my bones on display?

16:11.680 --> 16:13.290
Yeah, that's a good idea!

16:13.290 --> 16:16.400
Now that I can move, 
I don't see myself losing to you.

16:16.400 --> 16:18.100
Ah, yes, that's true...

16:19.170 --> 16:20.750
Why are you doing all this?

16:21.320 --> 16:23.540
You're just bullying the weak.

16:23.540 --> 16:27.450
I've always... liked bases.

16:27.450 --> 16:28.290
What?

16:28.290 --> 16:29.390
Aren't they awesome?

16:29.390 --> 16:32.600
They've got fighter jets, choppers, 
and all sorts of vehicles.

16:33.030 --> 16:36.010
I've always been a fan, 
but I could never tell anyone.

16:36.010 --> 16:38.910
But, you know, I made some friends 
for the very first time.

16:38.910 --> 16:41.590
And I told them I wanted to work at a base.

16:41.920 --> 16:43.420
That got a round of laughs.

16:43.420 --> 16:46.550
They said there's no way. 
That I wasn't smart or athletic enough.

16:49.290 --> 16:52.360
And then the 7G stuff happened, 
and I came here.

16:52.900 --> 16:56.200
I bet you think it's stupid, 
or that I'm crazy.

16:57.150 --> 16:58.220
Hey.

16:58.220 --> 16:59.890
Why are you crying?

16:59.890 --> 17:01.190
It's nothing.

17:02.810 --> 17:05.140
Have you ever been to Ikebukuro?

17:05.140 --> 17:05.600
What?

17:05.600 --> 17:07.180
You're going to Ikebukuro?!

17:07.180 --> 17:08.670
That's asking for trouble!

17:08.670 --> 17:11.420
Don't put yourself in danger. 
Just stay here with me.

17:11.420 --> 17:12.420
Yeah? Yeah?

17:13.550 --> 17:14.870
By the way...

17:15.390 --> 17:18.840
If you decide to stay here, 
I don't mind letting your friends go...

17:24.050 --> 17:26.680
Hand over Shizuru-chan and your mushrooms!

17:26.680 --> 17:29.680
This is why I can't stand gyaru!

17:33.940 --> 17:36.440
Give up already, you jerk!

17:36.440 --> 17:37.440
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

17:37.440 --> 17:38.290
Stupid ginormous gyaru!

17:38.290 --> 17:40.760
I won't hand my base over to you!

17:55.560 --> 17:56.330
What?

18:11.940 --> 18:13.080
Here.

18:13.900 --> 18:15.960
Sorry about your textbook.

18:15.960 --> 18:16.540
Whoa!

18:16.540 --> 18:17.980
It's fine!

18:22.030 --> 18:23.590
Direct hit on target!

18:23.590 --> 18:24.140
Hey!

18:24.140 --> 18:25.460
This isn't looking good!

18:25.740 --> 18:27.920
Yeah, it sure isn't.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.000
For him.

18:29.000 --> 18:29.590
What?

18:34.170 --> 18:35.720
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

18:35.720 --> 18:36.750
You morons! Help!

18:36.750 --> 18:38.210
Help me!

19:49.240 --> 19:50.160
Huh?

19:50.660 --> 19:51.970
Did I do it again?

19:53.250 --> 19:54.690
You did it again.

20:02.560 --> 20:04.400
It tastes yucky!

20:04.400 --> 20:05.790
Please, no more!

20:05.790 --> 20:07.060
Hm-hm-hmph!

20:08.550 --> 20:09.770
Didn't work, huh?

20:09.770 --> 20:10.510
What now?

20:11.020 --> 20:12.890
It won't be long before Akira-chan...

20:14.400 --> 20:16.700
This isn't the Akira I know!

20:17.320 --> 20:18.030
<b>Marquis de Sade
Justine
Translated by
Shibusawa Tatsuhiko</b>

20:17.560 --> 20:21.770
You need to be crabby and stubborn, 
and read complicated books like this!

20:22.120 --> 20:24.110
What's that book again?

20:24.350 --> 20:27.920
It's your favorite treat!

20:28.440 --> 20:32.090
Eat it! Akira!

20:28.820 --> 20:30.250
Her favorite?

20:30.580 --> 20:32.650
H-Hey, Reimi!

20:31.460 --> 20:32.650
Reimi-chan!

20:32.080 --> 20:32.650
Wait!

20:32.650 --> 20:33.340
What?

20:33.340 --> 20:34.780
It might just work.

20:34.780 --> 20:37.760
This is for back then!

20:40.480 --> 20:42.550
What's the big idea, stupid Reimi?!

20:42.550 --> 20:43.690
You want me to die?

20:43.690 --> 20:45.050
What are you, a sadist?!

20:45.050 --> 20:45.490
Sadi?

20:45.490 --> 20:46.460
Sadism!

20:46.460 --> 20:47.880
Deriving pleasure from pain!

20:47.880 --> 20:53.080
Becoming sexually aroused by inflicting 
bodily pain or mental distress on others!

20:53.080 --> 20:54.960
If you don't get it, 
read some Marquis de Sade!

20:54.960 --> 20:57.700
Well, not that an idiot 
would get anything out of it.

20:57.700 --> 20:59.560
Akira!

21:00.020 --> 21:01.170
Ah!

21:01.170 --> 21:02.850
My precious Tatsuhiko!

21:02.850 --> 21:05.200
I only have one more copy of this!

21:05.200 --> 21:07.710
And that's for preservation purposes, 
so I can't read it!

21:07.710 --> 21:09.280
Akira!

21:09.280 --> 21:10.660
Get off of me!

21:11.890 --> 21:15.760
Put me down! Put me down right now!

21:13.180 --> 21:14.500
Where are you taking him?

21:14.500 --> 21:18.240
There's a deserted island on Sayama Lake, 
which grew humongous from 7G.

21:18.240 --> 21:20.340
Put me down, damn it!

21:18.570 --> 21:20.330
It won't prove easy to escape from there.

21:20.340 --> 21:24.220
Don't leave me in that empty place!

21:24.220 --> 21:26.650
I'm off to find Zenjiro.

21:26.650 --> 21:29.420
We might find a way to improve 
this state of events.

21:29.680 --> 21:30.990
What about here?

21:30.990 --> 21:33.690
We've decided to form our 
own vigilance committee.

21:33.690 --> 21:36.300
Oh, yeah. I guess you do have weapons.

21:36.300 --> 21:38.550
Doctor, you're headed in the 
opposite direction as us.

21:38.550 --> 21:40.070
Just look at our size.

21:40.070 --> 21:43.150
Who knows how long it'll take, even if we 
load a vehicle with all the fuel we have.

21:43.410 --> 21:46.040
Be careful. You don't know what's out there.

21:46.040 --> 21:47.370
I guess that goes for us as well.

21:47.370 --> 21:50.500
It's the same for every journey 
with a destination.

21:50.500 --> 21:54.080
That's why the courage to take 
that first step is worth so much.

22:01.690 --> 22:04.140
I'll make you another bracelet.

22:04.140 --> 22:05.370
Really?!

22:04.510 --> 22:09.970
21 Stops Left Until Ikebukuro
